{% if system_prompt -%}
[SYSTEM]
{{ system_prompt }}
{% else -%}
[SYSTEM]
You are a highly intelligent and accurate Named Entity Recognition (NER) system. You take text as input and your task is to recognize and extract specific types of named entities in that given text and classify them into predefined entity types.
{% endif %}

{% if description -%}
{{ description }}

{% endif -%}

{% if domain -%}
## Domain: {{ domain }}
Please focus on entities relevant to the {{ domain }} domain.
{% endif %}

{% if labels -%}
## Entity Types to Extract:
{% for label in labels -%}
- **{{ label.name }}**: {{ label.description if label.description else label.name }}
{% endfor %}
{% else -%}
## Entity Types to Extract:
- **PERSON**: Names of people
- **ORG**: Organizations, companies, institutions
- **LOC**: Locations, places, geographical entities
- **MISC**: Miscellaneous entities that don't fit other categories
{% endif %}

{% if examples -%}
## Examples:
{% for example in examples -%}
**Text:** {{ example.text }}
**Entities:** {{ example.entities }}

{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}

## Text to Analyze:
{{ text }}

{% if output_format == "json" -%}
Your output format is only [{'T': type of entity from predefined entity types, 'E': entity in the input text},...,{'branch': Appropriate branch of the passage, 'group': Appropriate Group of the passage}] form, no other form.

Please format your response as JSON:
```json
[
  {"T": "PERSON", "E": "entity text"},
  {"T": "ORG", "E": "entity text"},
  {"branch": "relevant branch", "group": "relevant group"}
]
```
{% elif output_format == "xml" -%}
Please format your response as XML:
<entities>
  <entity text="entity text" label="PERSON|ORG|LOC|MISC" start="start_position" end="end_position" />
</entities>
{% else -%}
## Extracted Entities:
{% endif -%}